# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000367> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000367>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20042704") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://adni.loni.usc.edu/about/") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000367> "A multi-site longitudinal cohort of cognitively normal older adults and people with mild cognitive impairment or mild Alzheimer disease, recruited from 2004 at over 60 clinical sites in the United States and Canada by the Alzheimer's Disease Neuroimaging Initiative, a public-private partnership, to evaluate neuroimaging, fluid biomarker and clinical measures of Alzheimer disease progression.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000368> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000368>)

