# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000806> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000806>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24026564") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000806> "A population-based cohort of people with diabetes receiving primary care in an 11-county area of southern Wisconsin, United States, in 1979–1980, followed for decades to study the incidence and progression of diabetic retinopathy and other diabetes complications.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000807> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000807>)

